msgid "Warning: missed lessons in a row"
msgstr "Ogohlantirish: ketma-ket qoldirilgan darslar"

msgid ""
"After this many missed lessons in a row a task 'call the parent' appears. 0 "
"= off."
msgstr ""
"Shuncha dars ketma-ket qoldirilsa, \"ota-onaga qo'ng'iroq qilish\" vazifasi "
"chiqadi. 0 = o'chiq."

msgid "Warning about missed lessons goes to"
msgstr "Qoldirilgan darslar haqidagi ogohlantirish kimga"

msgid "Branch administrators"
msgstr "Filial administratorlari"

msgid "The group's teacher"
msgstr "Guruh o'qituvchisi"

msgid "Warning: debt overdue (days)"
msgstr "Ogohlantirish: qarz muddati o'tgan (kun)"

msgid ""
"A task for the branch administrators when a debt is this many days overdue. "
"0 = off."
msgstr ""
"Qarz muddati shuncha kun o'tganda filial administratorlariga vazifa chiqadi. "
"0 = o'chiq."

msgid "Repeat the debt warning every (days)"
msgstr "Qarz haqidagi ogohlantirishni takrorlash (har necha kunda)"

msgid ""
"A new task if the debt is still unpaid after this many more days. 0 = only "
"once."
msgstr ""
"Qarz shuncha kundan keyin ham to'lanmasa, yangi vazifa chiqadi. 0 = faqat "
"bir marta."

msgid "Warning: new lead not contacted within (working hours)"
msgstr "Ogohlantirish: yangi lid bilan bog'lanish muddati (ish soati)"

msgid "Counted only during working hours. 0 = off."
msgstr "Faqat ish vaqtida hisoblanadi. 0 = o'chiq."

msgid "Working hours start (hour)"
msgstr "Ish vaqti boshlanishi (soat)"

msgid "Working hours end (hour)"
msgstr "Ish vaqti tugashi (soat)"

msgid "Also send the lead warning to the manager's Telegram"
msgstr "Lid haqidagi ogohlantirishni menejerning Telegramiga ham yuborish"

